  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_024 (0.713 accuracy) is the best so far using scvi_n200 and resnet50 with transformer aggregation. This experiment tests using scgpt (RNA) + imagenet_vit_l (image) with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion, which combines high-performing encoders and the best aggregation method. It clarifies if the RNA encoder choice (scgpt vs scvi_n200) impacts performance with transformer aggregation. Expected cost is ~8.5 GPU hours (moderate increase from 6.22), justified by potential accuracy gains and exploration of a promising encoder combination."
}

